        "subheading": "",
        "title": "Where it all began...",
        "content": "<p>A father and a son, a small amount of stock to our name and a dream too big to put into words. </p><p>In 2010, William Wood was born in the garage of William Wood's late mother, May Wood.  We had one clear belief - the pieces you bring into your home should make it feel unforgettable.</p><p></p><p>We had one goal: To create exclusive, design-led pieces with an unwavering commitment to quality. All backed by a level of service that sets a new standard in homeware.<br/><br/>From 2010 to 2019, we faced countless challenges, and fought day in day out to keep William Wood alive.<br/><br/>Fast forward to 2020, William Wood was brought to life through innovative design, Instagram and our community, and sales tripled in one year.<br/></p><p>We've now had the pleasure of welcoming over 700,000 customers, and without each and every one of you, we wouldn't be the William Wood you know and love today.</p><p>The story continues, in homes like yours.<br/></p>",
        "button_text": "SHOP THE PIECES THAT MADE US",
        "button_link": "shopify://collections/best-sellers",
